{{collapse list|Forming a different country, including United States of Greater Austria, blocks this achievement.|
* The easiest way to weaken {{flag|Prussia}} is by changing {{flag|Bavaria}} and {{flag|Hesse-Kassel}} into your Customs Union and depriving Prussia of her territory in Brunswick, effectively cutting off the Prussian economy in the Rhineland. Afterwards, weaken Prussian power by humiliating them, changing more nations from their power bloc into yours, taking Upper and Lower Silesia and releasing nations from their territory like {{flag|Westphalia}} and {{flag|Danzig}}. Prussian AI will most likely try to conquer German minors by force, so remember to always take their side.}}

